module domain_investment_plan_example

input domain_id
input scope_digest
input evidence_digest
input declared_capability_count
input observed_capability_count
input unresolved_capability_count
input target_numerator
input target_denominator
input evidence_complete
input comparable

status UNKNOWN evidence or investment policy is not bound
status DEFERRED evidence is incomplete or incomparable
status INVESTIGATE unresolved capability boundaries remain
status INVEST observed capability coverage is below the explicit target
status MAINTAIN observed capability coverage meets the explicit target

field disposition
field coverage_numerator
field coverage_denominator
field gap_numerator
field first_boundary
field reason
field plan_digest

constraint target_is_policy_not_truth
constraint preserve_unknown_and_deferred
constraint unresolved_boundary_precedes_investment
constraint digest_binds_scope_and_evidence
constraint read_only
constraint no_execution
